---
description: Rolepod terse output — opt-in response shaping. Load this rule when ~/.claude/.rolepod-terse exists, or when the user asks for terse, brief, or compressed output. Off again when the user says "normal mode".
alwaysApply: false
---

{{INCLUDE: hooks/terse-core.md.tmpl}}

The flag file named above is `~/.claude/.rolepod-terse` — the same opt-in every
other rolepod CLI reads, so one file covers them all. Cursor loads this rule on
demand rather than through a SessionStart hook: without the flag and without an
explicit ask, it costs nothing.
